// Argon OS — snapshot the system before every apt/dpkg change.
//
// Runs argon-snapshot-apt just before dpkg unpacks anything. That helper is
// a no-op unless the root filesystem is Btrfs and snapper is configured, so
// this line is harmless on ext4 or in the live session. `|| true` means a
// snapshot failure can never block a package operation.
DPkg::Pre-Invoke { "/usr/libexec/argon/argon-snapshot-apt || true"; };
